      "content": "i guess i was thinking about what you said... about making the waiting count. i'm just so tired of the struggle, the doctors, the pills, and just being a burden to everyone. it feels like i've lost all my agency. wouldn't it be better to just choose how it ends, instead of letting it drag on like this?",
